source: crates/nb-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: help
---
notability account — Sign-in session, profile, quotas, settings, calendar, raw GraphQL

Usage: notability account <command>

Commands:
  calendar  Upcoming calendar events
  flags     Feature flags
  graphql   Raw GraphQL query (queries only)
  login     Import a session (from a browser over CDP, or a token on stdin)
  logout    Forget the stored session
  me        Profile of the signed-in user
  quotas    AI / transcription quotas
  refresh   Re-import the session cookie
  settings  Account settings and toggles
  status    Is the session valid? (--offline)
  stickers  Sticker packs
  survey    Onboarding survey answers

Global Options:
  --filter-output <keys>              Filter output by key paths (e.g. foo,bar.baz,a[0,3])
  --format <toon|json|yaml|md|jsonl>  Output format
  --full-output                       Show full output envelope
  --help                              Show help
  --llms, --llms-full                 Print LLM-readable manifest
  --schema                            Show JSON Schema for command
  --token-count                       Print token count of output (instead of output)
  --token-limit <n>                   Limit output to n tokens
  --token-offset <n>                  Skip first n tokens of output
